{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7f17d2f7-4a3f-8949-b6a7-d10f1cd29f4a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-16T11:38:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paulo Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about water coming out of a pipe at the curb on my street. It's running onto the sidewalk and it's freezing solid. [pause] It's a sheet of ice out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "175 Kay Street, up on the Hill. Right in front of the house, the pipe at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 175 Kay Street. And is this from rain or snow, or is it just running by itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:35:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No storm. It's been dry for days. It's just running. Constantly. Day and night, as I said before, it doesn't stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "As you said before, so you've called about this already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:35:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[sighs] Well, no, not called. I mean I've been watching it for a couple weeks. I figured somebody would notice. But it's January and now the whole sidewalk is a skating rink. Mail carrier almost went down yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I can see why you're calling. Has it been like this before, or is this new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was not this bad last winter. There was a little damp spot, maybe, some mornings. Nothing like this. Now it's a steady stream and it's ice all the way to the neighbor's driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So water's coming right out of the pipe at the curb, steady, with no rain involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Right. So when did they last come by? Somebody from the city has to have looked at that drain line at some point. When was the last time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a record in front of me of the last visit to that spot. I can put in a service request now and have it go to the crew supervisor, and they can check the history."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's a no on when. Okay. [sighs] Fine, put it in. But I want somebody out there to actually look. Not salt it and leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that. It's a drainage problem in dry weather, ice forming on the public sidewalk, and a pedestrian hazard. Let me get a callback number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0165. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. It's a very old number. I've had it since way back, and I'm not changing it, so don't ask me to. It works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I wasn't going to. That's fine, it's what I've got. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paulo Medeiros. M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Medeiros. Okay, so I've got it down: 175 Kay Street, continuous water from the curb pipe, freezing on the sidewalk, worse than last winter, and you'd like to know when it was last inspected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And I want to know how soon. Because today's Friday and if nobody comes till next week, that's the whole weekend of ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll mark it as a hazard so it gets looked at quickly, but I can't tell you an exact time. The supervisor should call you back, probably today or Monday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Great. [pause] Okay. Well, if somebody falls out there, that's on the city, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. In the meantime, if you can, put some sand or salt down by your own walk, and keep people off the icy part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I already did that. Twice. It just freezes over again because the water keeps coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, of course. Okay, the request is in. If it gets worse or the ice spreads into the street, call back right away and tell them it's an update to this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Alright. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T11:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, and watch your step out there."
    }
  ],
